183	/** A sheet's settings: the role each user name has on it (a clerk unless made a steward) and its clerk
184	 * limit, the most a clerk may settle a claim for (none when null), and its floor, the least a claim's
185	 * live due can be, and its terms, how many days after its date a claim is due by, and its late percent, the
186	 * percent of its figure an overdue claim's due gains for every full 30 days it is overdue, and its policy
187	 * date, which decides how a claim's live figures round (the sheet's today when none is set), and its
188	 * period numbering from, the date from which a claim opened is numbered within its period (off when null). */
189	@Service
190	public class SettingsService {
191	
